Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Speed up navigation: fewer sequential queries, region
 pin, link pending state

- Readiness computed in one aggregated query; batched for portfolio and leads
- Context loads memberships, support session and provider grant in parallel
- Platform settings cached per instance (30 s)
- Overview, room and team pages run independent queries in parallel
- vercel.json pins functions to sin1 next to Neon ap-southeast-1
- Sidebar links show a pending indicator during navigation
- Forms keep a server action fallback so pre-hydration submits never use GET
- E2E waits made robust

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01C1pAKTDBdroaEvQsUdahDj
